{"id":"uderzhat_","lemma":"удержать","pos":"verb","rank":1665,"glosses":["to retain, to hold, to withhold","to balance, to place or set an object so that it does not fall","to suppress"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8c/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B6%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B6%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"future":{"1s":"удержу","2s":"удержишь","3s":"удержит","1p":"удержим","2p":"удержите","3p":"удержат"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"удержи","2p":"удержите"}}},"past":{"m":"удержал","p":"удержали","f":"удержала","n":"удержало"},"aspect":"perfective","aspectPartner":"удерживать","examples":[{"text":"Ничто не может меня удержать.","en":"Nothing can deter me.","words":[{"g":"nothing"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null]},{"text":"Том удержал меня от этого шага.","en":"Tom stopped me from doing that.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"step","l":"шаг"}]},{"text":"Он удержал меня от совершения большой ошибки.","en":"He kept me from making a big mistake.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"from"},null,{"g":"big, large, great"},{"g":"mistake, error, fault","l":"ошибка"}]},{"text":"Постарайся удержать еду в себе.","en":"Try to keep it down.","words":[{"g":"to try, to attempt","l":"постараться"},null,{"g":"to go","l":"ехать"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"myself","l":"себя"}]},{"text":"Никто не сможет удержать меня от того, чтобы пойти туда.","en":"No one can keep me from going there.","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be able, to manage","l":"смочь"},null,{"g":"me","l":"я"},{"g":"from"},{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"that...should"},{"g":"to go"},{"g":"there"}]}]}